# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in.

# Where the contact form POSTs its JSON payload
# ({ name, email, phone, service, message }).
#
# Leave this UNSET for local development: the form validates fully and resolves
# a simulated success, logging the payload to the console. Nothing is sent.
#
# Works with any endpoint that accepts a JSON POST — Formspree, Web3Forms,
# Netlify Functions, a Vercel serverless route, or your own API.
#
# VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxxx
